WEBVTT

01:13:52.084 --> 01:13:52.959
Sir.

01:13:53.042 --> 01:13:55.792
Go and ask if he would
like to have coffee or tea.

01:13:56.167 --> 01:13:57.167
Okay, sir.

01:13:57.625 --> 01:13:58.875
-Did you get it?
-Sir?

01:13:59.500 --> 01:14:00.500
Ask him.

01:14:01.750 --> 01:14:03.542
-Don't serve anything. Go.
-Okay, sir.
